<main id="main" class="wrap project-page"><a class="back-link" href="../index.html#projects">All projects</a><p class="eyebrow">Robotics · Motion planning</p><h1>Backpack-Mounted Third Robot Arm</h1><p class="lead">Motion planning and stabilization for COBORG, a wearable robotic arm that assists technicians with overhead panel installation.</p><div class="detail-result"><strong>84.62%</strong><span>task success in panel installation tests</span></div><div class="prose"><p>COBORG is a backpack-mounted exoskeleton designed to act as an extra hand for overhead manufacturing and assembly. The platform helps an operator support and position panels while reducing the need for a second person.</p>
<h2>My contribution</h2><ul><li>Led the motion planning subsystem in C++ for a 4-DOF wearable robotic arm.</li><li>Developed a multi-stage pipeline transitioning from end-effector position control to force control using MoveIt and Octomap in ROS Melodic.</li><li>Implemented a resolved rate controller to compensate for user motion of up to 6 inches of translation and 90 degrees of rotation.</li></ul>
<h2>Results</h2><p>The system achieved an 84.62% task success rate and a 100% safety success rate in panel installation tests with panels weighing up to 15 lbs.</p>
<p><a class="text-link" href="https://mrsdprojects.ri.cmu.edu/2021teamc/">Visit the COBORG project website</a></p></div><section class="demos" aria-labelledby="demos-title"><h2 id="demos-title">See COBORG in action</h2><p>Original demonstrations from the project.</p><h3>Project overview</h3><iframe class="video" title="COBORG: Project overview" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KbwLp_TAgcU" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe><p><a href="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KbwLp_TAgcU">Open project overview separately</a></p><h3>End effector accuracy test</h3><iframe class="video" title="COBORG: End effector accuracy test" src="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LZfXQtvU2pmOH0otfTaloOf_ucpYg7or/preview" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe><p><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LZfXQtvU2pmOH0otfTaloOf_ucpYg7or/preview">Open end effector accuracy test separately</a></p><h3>Full demo with voice commands and metal panel</h3><iframe class="video" title="COBORG: Full demo with voice commands and metal panel" src="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Iuk1qIVirmbxv8St-rF27lW7pGzdz_bC/preview" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe><p><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Iuk1qIVirmbxv8St-rF27lW7pGzdz_bC/preview">Open full demo with voice commands and metal panel separately</a></p><h3>Updated manipulator path demo</h3><iframe class="video" title="COBORG: Updated manipulator path demo" src="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LsKZbSpOL0zS88eg9NQ5itl-pmrVkPMF/preview" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe><p><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LsKZbSpOL0zS88eg9NQ5itl-pmrVkPMF/preview">Open updated manipulator path demo separately</a></p></section><p class="project-end"><a class="button secondary" href="../index.html#projects">Back to selected projects</a